{"story_id":40155,"updated_at":"2026-10-24T01:14:28","headline_en":"Rajnath Singh directs Army commanders to draft 30-year strategic vision","headline_hi":"राजनाथ सिंह ने सेना कमांडरों को 30-वर्षीय रणनीतिक विजन तैयार करने का निर्देश दिया।","payload_en":{"story_id":40155,"headline":"Rajnath Singh directs Army commanders to draft 30-year strategic vision","counts":{"articles":5,"independent_sources":4,"outlets":4},"has_established":true,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Amar Ujala","Live Hindustan","News18 Hindi","The Hindu"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":40155,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-24T01:14:28","category":{"primary":["world","politics"],"secondary":["defence","government"]},"places":[],"people":["Rajnath Singh","Commanders Conference","Land Warfare Doctrine","Operation Sindoor","United Nations Journal"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Defence Minister Rajnath Singh called on the Army’s senior leadership to develop a long-term strategic vision for the next 20-30 years.","ids":[66856],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4]}],[{"text":"On Friday 23 October Singh addressed the Army Commanders' Conference in New Delhi, addressing the closing day of the event.","ids":[66801,66853],"parts":[{"text":"On Friday 23 October Singh addressed the Army Commanders' Conference in New Delhi,","ids":[66801],"class":"established"},{"text":"addressing the closing day of the event.","ids":[66853],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3,4]}],[{"text":"Singh released the Land Warfare Doctrine.","ids":[66861],"class":"established","sources":[1,3,4]}],[{"text":"Singh unveiled the annual United Nations Journal.","ids":[66855],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"\"India's defense production reached 1.78 lakh crore rupees in the 2025-26 financial year,\" and India's defense exports reached a record level of approximately 38,000 crore rupees in the 2025-26 financial year, Singh said.","ids":[6680